<h3 id="top-bar">Top Bar</h3>
<p>
	In GymPress you will find highly customizable Top Bar area. Both left and right top side are made with widgets which can be added or removed here - <kbd><kbd><samp>Appearance</samp></kbd>&nbsp;→ <kbd><samp>Widgets</samp></kbd>&nbsp;→ <kbd><samp>Top Left or Top Right</samp></kbd></kbd>.
</p>
<p>Top Bar supported widgets:</p>
<ul>
	<li>Icon Box</li>
	<li>Social Icons</li>
	<li>Custom Menu</li>
	<li>Text Widget</li>
</ul>